# What the image never needs. node_modules above all: a Windows copy would
# overwrite the Linux one npm ci has just installed. Secrets, logs and local
# data are left out at any depth, not just at the root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.claude
.superpowers
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.log
docs
images
legacy
research
e2e
packages/server/data
**/survey-out
